<title>USA: NOPA corrects April soybean statistics.</title>
<headline>NOPA corrects April soybean statistics.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Oilseed Processors Association on Friday corrected its April soybean ownership data contained in its monthly processing report to 160,503,000 bushels from the 175,295,000 bushels reported Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the revision reflects strictly old crop beans. A corrected version of the April soybean crushings and processing data follows.  </p>
