<p> -		Illinois   17,883    22,211    18,613</p>
<p> - Ind, Ky, Ohio, Mich   20,602    22,165    18,680</p>
<p> -	     Southeast   19,022    20,952    19,967</p>
<p> -	 South Central    9,983    13,100    11,566</p>
<p> -	     Southwest   16,130    17,785    13,872</p>
<p> -		    Iowa   20,722    23,027    21,092</p>
<p> - Minn, N/SDak., Mont    8,117     8,951     7,664</p>
<p> -	    Total U.S.  112,457   128,191   111,454</p>
